,"name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","review_id":"BympxGeTSjm3l5XZTC-dCw","date":"2014-06-11T18:51:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354332685470581,"text_excerpt":"I love Good Eggs. Love 'em. Here's why: Quality: I won't expound on the healthful and ecological benefits of locally-sourced, organic produce, grass-fed meats, pastured chickens & eggs, and non-homogenized dairy. If you don't know, Google it, but the gist is that it's profoundly better than factory farms and mass-produced genetically and chemically-altered food products, both for your health and for the environment, in so many ways. Really, look it up. Price: As much as everyone complains about the price of local/organic food and how it's not affordable, I'm finding that I'm actually spending less. I've been ordering a weekly delivery from GoodEggs for a couple of months, and now I only g..."},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","review_id":"Jnv-LqPcB-xknd_gFvtV3w","date":"2015-05-12T18:09:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9353815913200378,"text_excerpt":"I've been using Good Eggs for grocery home delivery for a few months now and have been really happy with the service. They offer high quality local products with fair market pricing. My regular orders go something like this: 1 dozen pastured eggs half and half or milk fruit (strawberries or apples) veggies (stuff I can use in stir fry or potatoes if I know I'll be making breakfast) half a loaf of sourdough prepared food item (crawfish etoufee, baba ganoush, etc) tortillas (from Holy Nola, my fave) a flourless cookie from Gracious Bakery meat product (sausage or shrimp or beef) avocados (not local and they do tell you that but they are from California instead of Mexico so there's that) I'v..."},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","review_id":"-bD4RO_R4qSzdmph8Zetjw","date":"2014-07-18T16:23:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9297893047332764,"text_excerpt":"I love Good Eggs so much I want to give this service (and possibly the entire staff) a GIANT HUG. Like, this is serious love, man. I don't even *like* hugs (unless I know you very well. I have personal space issues). I hate, loathe and despise grocery stores. Whole Foods, I can handle on a limited basis and I really have to force myself to go because, hello, it's watermelon and cherry season. And being a veggie junkie, I do know that that food isn't just going to magically appear on my doorstep. Or will it? Because Good Eggs can make it happen. I typically get all my seasonal/local produce delivered right to my door and unless you wish it to arrive during a very specific time window, ther..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","photo_id":"1P7aY5qvHeB3HabXjKJJZg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1P7aY5qvHeB3HabXjKJJZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9527785778045654},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","photo_id":"YGAG-cTKw0hrLDuORUWkgQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YGAG-cTKw0hrLDuORUWkgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9475250244140625},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","photo_id":"cbtnTMe8_rQ-3J_7XTqLTg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cbtnTMe8_rQ-3J_7XTqLTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9408865571022034},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","photo_id":"TrNlHxHAEQZ7LfhIGyxS-Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TrNlHxHAEQZ7LfhIGyxS-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8784868717193604},{"business_id":"5ek43v9QoJAPS8CBuBeFgg","photo_id":"DvEBMw7gYGJRu2GjE8VYbg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DvEBMw7gYGJRu2GjE8VYbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8080618381500244}]},"notebook_case":null}
